<title>INDIA: Indian ad hoc t-bills 11.65 bln rupees on Feb 28.</title>
<headline>Indian ad hoc t-bills 11.65 bln rupees on Feb 28.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-03-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Reserve Bank of India (RBI) said on Monday the net issue of ad hoc treasury bills on February 28, 1997 was 11.65 billion rupees above the March 31, 1996 level.</p>
<p>It was 15.70 billion rupees on February 21, the RBI added in a statement.</p>
